  "title": "Nu Skin Enterprises Announces Quarterly Dividend",
  "summary": "PROVO, Utah --(BUSINESS WIRE)--Aug. 10, 2026-- Nu Skin Enterprises, Inc. (NYSE: NUS) today announced its board of directors has declared a quarterly cash dividend of $0.06 per share, which will be paid on Sept. 9, 2026, to shareholders of record on Aug. 28, 2026. About Nu Skin Enterprises Inc.",
